  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><h2 data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"261\" id=\"isPasted\">• About our brand and products:</h2><p data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"579\">We create bold, conversation-starting apparel and accessories designed to make people stop, smile, and think. From funny T-shirts and dark-humor hats to unique lifestyle products, everything we sell is built with quality and originality. Our goal is simple: give people a way to express themselves unapologetically.</p><hr data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"584\"><h2 data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"617\">• What makes us different:</h2><p data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"929\">Most brands play it safe. We don’t.<br data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"656\">Our products combine <strong data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"732\">edgy humor, cultural commentary, and unique designs</strong> that you won’t find in big-box stores. Every piece is made to be wearable art — something that gets attention both online and in person. We thrive on originality, relatability, and authenticity.</p><hr data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"934\"><h2 data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"967\">• How affiliates can earn:</h2><ul data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1246\"><li data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1021\"><p data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1021\"><strong data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"995\">High commission rates</strong> on every sale you drive</p></li><li data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1081\"><p data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1081\"><strong data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1037\">No limits</strong> — the more you promote, the more you earn</p></li><li data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1153\"><p data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1153\"><strong data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1107\">Recurring potential</strong> when customers you refer come back for more</p></li><li data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1246\"><p data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1246\">Access to <strong data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1214\">exclusive discounts, promos, and early drops</strong> to help you boost conversions</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1251\"><h2 data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1278\">• How to promote us:</h2><ul data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1600\"><li data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1357\"><p data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1357\">Share your affiliate links on <strong data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1355\">Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, or Twitter/X</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1440\"><p data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1440\">Create fun content: outfit pics, memes, or short videos featuring our products</p></li><li data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1504\"><p data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1504\">Use trending hashtags and challenges to maximize visibility</p></li><li data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1600\"><p data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1600\">Add your personal style — our products are designed to stand out, so your audience will too</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1605\"><h2 data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1632\">• Other information:</h2><ul data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1909\"><li data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1699\"><p data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1699\">Affiliates get <strong data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1697\">first access to new designs and collections</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1798\"><p data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1798\">We provide <strong data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1744\">ready-to-use content assets</strong> (images, captions, hashtags) to make promotion easy</p></li><li data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1857\"><p data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1857\">Simple sign-up, hassle-free tracking, and fast payouts</p></li><li data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1909\"><p data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1909\">No cost to join — just share, promote, and earn</p></li></ul></div>",
